			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Rollie has been seen in Norrath and swoonin babes are reported eveywhere! Citizens are urged not to panic! Da swoonin effects last only a short while, and swoonin over Rollie is not considered a bad thing.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
