			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Grats Fenya on finally getting your epic!  It is well deserved and quite an honor!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><font face="Arial"><small><a href="http://pub41.ezboard.com/flasthopeecifrm1.showMessage?topicID=111.topic">Click here to find out more!</a></small><br></font></td>
<td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=39">Delendra</a> <small>9:06am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
