			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">February 18, 2001 <strong>Sky Raid Completed!!!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=34"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=34&a=17"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Had a fantastic raid!! Thanks to everyone who helped make it possible!!! We were able to get epic items for Grizztul, Scarlita, Diggo, Biffen, Smarlg, Fenya, Dranak and Mordone, Virginiana and Iridiom completed their FAs, had some great drops for various classes and loads of quest items which some folks were able to complete quests with.<br>
<br>
Grats to all and thanks again!!!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=17">Diggo</a> <small>9:46pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
